56
00:07:17,660 --> 00:07:19,028
[Host] Hot spring.

57
00:07:19,627 --> 00:07:30,620
[Slow] 国税庁は、「土地の値段が上がる強い流れが、地方にも広がっている」と話しています。

58
00:07:31,420 --> 00:07:37,540
[Host] The Tax Agency says the strong upward trend in land prices is spreading to the regions too.

59
00:07:38,139 --> 00:07:40,468
