83
00:11:19,491 --> 00:11:35,403
[Host] That's today's Japanese Daily News. Land prices are climbing again — and this time the gains are reaching resort towns and smaller regions, not just the big cities. Full transcript and vocabulary are on the site. See you tomorrow.

